0Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T23:25:48+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgH9drAk_G2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgH9drAk_G2","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T12:31:04.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T23:25:48+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHo2FRFOLK","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgHo2FRFOLK","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"同一副 AirPods 用了幾年，你知道自己累積聽了多久嗎？PodHours 能把 Apple「健康」匯出的紀錄整理成每副耳機的聆聽時數、常用時段和平均音量。工具標示在瀏覽器內解析檔案，參加排行榜才會上傳聆聽紀錄。\n\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-24T09:30:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T23:25:48+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHo2odFJnU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgHo2odFJnU","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T09:30:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T23:25:48+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHgC2Civ3O","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgHgC2Civ3O","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"「是我說服輝達董事會的」川普打電話上 CNBC 講了 50 分鐘\n\n一週半前董事會還說「門都沒有」，川普說是股價「跌了 50%」讓董事會好做決定（CNBC 報導實際約 25%）。他還說失去黃仁勳才是更大的威脅、想像中國會請他去掌管華為。被問政府要不要入股輝達，他說「我不想以內線交易告政府」，而他的投資帳戶 9 月才買過輝達。你覺得這是救了輝達，還是政府管太多？","timestamp":"2026-11-24T08:14:37.000Z","stats":{"likes":13,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":16,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T23:25:48+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHUhOKlMkC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgHUhOKlMkC","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"入門電腦好不容易普及 16GB，現在又可能看到 8GB 機型變多。華碩在法說會表示，記憶體漲價難以全數反映在售價上，部分中低階產品可能會調整規格。常開多個分頁、邊視訊邊工作的話，選購前可以先看看容量差在哪。\n\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-24T06:33:17.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T23:25:48+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHUhr2FIkG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgHUhr2FIkG","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T06:33:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T23:25:48+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgGv7AZE4cS","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgGv7AZE4cS","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-24T01:13:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T11:22:06+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgGv6XIE1k1","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgGv6XIE1k1","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Windows 工作列的乙太網路圖示一直閃？剛開機時，電腦可能還在跟路由器建立連線。如果等了一會兒仍上不了網，可以先換條網路線或換個 LAN 孔，再逐步排查 VPN 和網卡驅動。文中整理 5 個排查方向，也提醒哪些操作會清掉設定。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-24T01:13:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T11:22:06+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgFyP4DE-Lm","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgFyP4DE-Lm","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"youtu.be/FGiNZ…","timestamp":"2026-11-23T16:14:35.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T11:22:06+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgFyPP1E7-8","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgFyPP1E7-8","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"黃仁勳回來了！從被迫辭職到全票請回，輝達 11 天大翻盤始末","timestamp":"2026-11-23T16:14:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":30,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":32,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T11:22:06+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgFZRnTlHF2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgFZRnTlHF2","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"想在另一套作業系統跑 Windows 軟體？從 ReactOS 分支的 LiberNT，以 Windows 11 24H2 為相容目標，已有 AMD64、ARM64 等架構的開發映像。原文作者在虛擬機試跑時，下載驅動就遇到當機。想知道目前做到哪一步，可以先看這次試用。\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-23T12:36:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgFPI7Uiuxi","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgFPI7Uiuxi","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"中國開源模型以外的新選擇！Inkling 2 Mini 網友實測：8GB 老顯卡也跑得動\n\n前 OpenAI 技術長 Mira Murati 的 Thinking Machines，推出能在筆電離線跑的開源模型 Inkling 2 Mini。官方說能力追平 Qwen3.8-27B，網友實測結果如何？\n\n✅ 中間 12 層重複跑 3 次：24 層當 48 層用，整包約 20GB\n✅ 8GB RTX 2060 Super 用 1 位元版每秒 30.7 token；RTX 5090 破 400\n✅ 日本 Classmethod 用 DGX Spark 實測：速度是 Qwen 的 3 倍多、49 個程式測試全過\n⚠️ 40 個工具挑 1 個，6 次只對 1 次；95 萬 token 長文件，第一個字等 26.5 分鐘\n\n你的電腦跑得動嗎？留言告訴我們 👇\n原文：kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-23T11:08:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgFEvVvFHwn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgFEvVvFHwn","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"拆筆電最怕起子頭選錯，一轉就把螺絲弄花。Arrowspace S1 把攝影機放在電動起子尾端，拍下螺絲後，由手機 App 判斷類型與尺寸。搭配智慧收納盒，對應的起子頭格子還會亮燈。這款工具仍在募資，實際使用有哪些限制？\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-23T09:36:56.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgEv9YhlDmn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DgEv9YhlDmn","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"一台電腦放不下的 AI 模型，有機會拆到幾台一起跑。微軟預告透過 USB4 串聯 Windows 電腦，分攤記憶體與 GPU 運算。官方用三台各有 128 GB 記憶體的迷你電腦，跑起 4 位元量化的 2,350 億參數模型。開發者預覽日期尚未公布。\n文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-23T06:35:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[{"id":"DgHFNTao_cC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DgHFNTao_cC","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"可喜可賀🔥🔥\n\nAI懶人報拆解課程，上線五天突破30人付費支持了🥹 超過13萬台幣進帳，也有很多人給我鼓勵與五星好評，還是一樣，感恩的心♥️，謝謝大家的喜歡，對我來說把自己的流程分享出來包裝成數位產品，本身就是一種新鮮的學習體驗，賺多少錢我並不是太在意，但看到自己的內容有人願意付費支持，能幫助到有需要的人，也走了一趟AI課程從規劃，製作，優化，上架，行銷的過程，我自己才是受惠最多的人🫶\n\n這幾天帶家人來日本玩，好好放鬆一下，也恭喜老黃王者歸來，太神啦!!","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:19:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":120,"replies":19,"reposts":4,"shares":31},"score":170,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T23:25:48+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df_wzTJo1A6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/Df_wzTJo1A6","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"透過AI經營自媒體，一個月漲粉將近五萬，把Skills開放不就代表會快速多很多競爭帳號？！\n\n這是我收到最多的問題！\n\n很多人很意外我會把AI懶人報完整的Skills都公開在課程包，但我並不擔心，因為我覺得這並不是懶人報最有價值的部分，真的要打造一個AI Agent系統，最有用的反而是讓大家知道我踩過的坑，我如何使用這些大家都能拿到的工具，做出大家想看高價值的內容，如何透過試錯調整優化pipeline的底層邏輯，如何打造人和Agent協作的系統，我都做成了一個小時的內容幫大家好好拆解了！\n\n這些Skills跟風格，我任何都可以非常快速的迭代變化，唯一不變讓你更有競爭力的是Mindset跟品味，也是為什麼我認為這堂課最有料的部分，目前早鳥價65折，有夠超值🔥💪","timestamp":"2026-11-21T08:06:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":21,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":27,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Df_wzO1Ixf9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/Df_wzO1Ixf9","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"portaly.cc/ailrb…","timestamp":"2026-11-21T08:06:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DgHtiBSlG-s","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgHtiBSlG-s","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Meta Edits 最神的\n當然是內建 MCP 讓 AI 來幫你剪片\n\n除以之外還有很多影片相關功能：\n→ 上字幕、加特效、影片之間的轉場\n→ 4K 匯出沒有浮水印\n→ 內建音樂庫和音效\n→ 支援提詞機錄音跟雙語自動字幕\n→ 連 LUTs 和 Apple Log 還原都能做到\n\n以上這些除了你可以自己調整\nAI 也能直接幫你做完\n\n最後一頁可以看看 AI 自己排完的四軌時間軸\n想試 Mac 免費剪片的話可以直接載來玩玩看！","timestamp":"2026-11-24T10:12:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":41,"replies":2,"reposts":6,"shares":33},"score":63,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T23:25:48+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgHKPGbEdr1","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgHKPGbEdr1","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Google 大佛心\n\n終於把 Carbon 下放給 Pro 用戶了\n而且 Argon 那條獨立的 Usage 也合併\n最近也會沒事就重置一下\n\n至於是否推薦後面黑五直上年繳方案\n我覺得要看你願不願意想花三千塊\n很難保證 Google 是都只會在 Q4 才發力\n還是明年一整年都能維持很有競爭力","timestamp":"2026-11-24T05:03:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":47,"replies":15,"reposts":1,"shares":3},"score":80,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T23:25:48+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgFsIqbnwnq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgFsIqbnwnq","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"有生之年還會看到 NVDA 一天漲 33% 嗎","timestamp":"2026-11-23T15:21:10.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgC9dlej6WT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgC9dlej6WT","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"AI 自動化剪片又突破到下一個層級了！\n\n如果你也是無法放心整支影片都給 AI 剪\n現在又多了一個強大的工具可以用\n而且完全免費\n\nMeta Edit 有 MacOS 版本，而且內建 MCP 讓 AI 操作\n所以影片上的動作全部是 Claude 自己做的\n1. 匯入素材\n2. 挑選背景音樂\n3. 逐段加上音效\n4. 還能幫忙設定轉場\n（影片沒有做任何加速）\n\n也就是說 AI 可以照著你想要的方式快速完成初剪\n你再回來做最後的精修跟調整就好","timestamp":"2026-11-22T13:59:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":55,"replies":8,"reposts":9,"shares":50},"score":98,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgAgvdIH--j","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgAgvdIH--j","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"developers.facebook.com/docum…","timestamp":"2026-11-21T15:05:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DgAdD3wzeaT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DgAdD3wzeaT","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"居然可以用 AI 來操作 Meta Developer 後台\n\nMeta 最近推出\nMeta Social Technologies MCP\n串到 AI 後，就能請 AI 幫你建立一個 Developer App\n然後... 就只能這樣了 🫠\n頂多再幫忙開好 使用者場景\n\n什麼時候會用到 Meta 開發者後台？\n當你需要用自動化串接 Threads, IG, FB 粉專\n例如讓 AI 幫你發文，或是取得裡面的分析數據\n\n目前這工具偏向工程師\n一般使用者需要的 Token 無法直接建立\n相信是安全考量，這部分很難自動化\n但管理 App 上面的設定或是取得使用量等等還是蠻方便","timestamp":"2026-11-21T14:33:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":26,"replies":5,"reposts":1,"shares":29},"score":39,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Df_ZvbnEWr3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Df_ZvbnEWr3","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"連結：one.google.com/ai…\n\n勘誤：Drive 是5tb","timestamp":"2026-11-21T04:45:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":6},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Df_Wbc1EYnV","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Df_Wbc1EYnV","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Google AI 方案居然有黑五\nPlus 和 Pro 的年繳可以 5 折！\n\n但現在的會員早鳥期間\n能不能看到特價是個謎\n蠻多人在社群上都反應看不到的\n\nPro 算下來一年 100 美金左右而已\n光有 Google Drive 2tb 都賺\n\nGoogle 的 AI 模型最近也是脫胎換骨一輪\nGemini 4 改用化學老師後跑分表現都還不錯\n或許是個訂閱的好時機\n\n⚠️ 是年訂閱方案，如果覺得自己會後悔那就得等一年後才能取消","timestamp":"2026-11-21T04:16:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":105,"replies":42,"reposts":1,"shares":135},"score":192,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[{"id":"Df_zxWBCfMC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@c.yu.an_/post/Df_zxWBCfMC","username":"c.yu.an_","displayName":"c.yu.an_","content":"搞新創會開始染上出國才會解壓的習慣（？","timestamp":"2026-11-21T08:32:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":19,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T03:58:57+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DgFzSaplAOx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DgFzSaplAOx","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"Rrrrrr! Jensen is back 🥲🥲🥲\n痛哭","timestamp":"2026-11-23T16:23:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-24T11:22:06+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}